@startuml
' diagram-type: sequence
!include ../../.style/plantuml.iuml
title Current startup and request interactions
participant "MCP client" as C
participant CLI as L
participant "MCP server" as S
participant "Core archive" as A
participant "Insight writer" as W
participant "Six analyzers" as D
participant "Insight resources" as R
participant Filesystem as F
alt MCP mode
L -> S : serve with archive path
S -> A : open ZIP and index metadata
A --> S : Archive or startup error
note over S : start stdio only after open succeeds
C -> S : tools/call with typed parameters
S -> A : metadata query or fresh content reader
A --> S : value or ArchiveError
S --> C : ToolEnvelope or error
C -> S : resources/list
S -> R : discover complete sibling set
R -> A : bound archive SHA-256
R -> F : metadata + system identity
R --> S : seven descriptors or absence/error
S --> C : resource metadata
C -> S : resources/read with returned URI
S -> R : read exact artifact
R -> F : bounded UTF-8 read + identity check
R --> S : full text or explicit error
S --> C : resource contents
C -> S : stdin EOF
S --> L : service completion
else Insight mode
L -> W : generate_to(path)
W -> A : open ZIP
W -> F : reserve unique staging
W -> D : generate_insight(Archive)
D -> A : bounded read-only evidence
D --> W : six artifact models + README
W -> W : validate contracts
W -> F : create and sync seven files
W -> F : atomic rename, no replacement
F --> W : published path or error
W --> L : result; cleanup owned staging on error
end
@enduml
